flowchart TD
    A[Client sends multipart image to .NET] --> B[ASP.NET Core binds IFormFile]
    B --> C[ImageFileValidator checks size, metadata, and signature]

    C --> D{Validation successful?}
    D -- No --> E[Return 400 validation ProblemDetails]
    D -- Yes --> F[Sanitize display filename]

    F --> G[Copy validated image into byte array]
    G --> H[PaddleOcrClient creates multipart HTTP request]
    H --> I[Send image to Python service]

    I --> J{Python service reachable?}
    J -- No --> K[Return 503 ocr_service_unavailable]
    J -- Timeout --> L[Return 504 ocr_timeout]
    J -- Yes --> M{Python response successful?}

    M -- No --> N[Return 502 ocr_service_error]
    M -- Yes --> O[Deserialize and validate OCR JSON]

    O --> P{OCR contract valid?}
    P -- No --> Q[Return 502 ocr_invalid_response]
    P -- Yes --> R[Store original image with generated filename]

    R --> S{Storage successful?}
    S -- No --> T[Return 500 image_storage_failed]
    S -- Yes --> U[Map PaddleOCR DTO to public raw OCR DTO]

    U --> V[Return image metadata and raw OCR]
    V --> W[200 OK]